| WebCLAP port ([open-webclap](https://github.com/andremichelle/open-webclap) `ports/aymidi`, `ports/dpf`) | open-webclap contributors | MIT |
| Emscripten sysroot, linked statically: musl libc, LLVM libc++ and libc++abi | musl authors; LLVM Project | MIT; Apache-2.0 with LLVM exceptions |

